# Hexo Blog Project Structure

This is a Hexo-based blog with the following key components:

## Configuration Files
- [_config.yml](mdc:hexo-blog/_config.yml) - Main Hexo configuration
- [_config.vivia.yml](mdc:hexo-blog/_config.vivia.yml) - Vivia theme configuration

## Content
- [source/_posts/](mdc:hexo-blog/source/_posts) - Blog post content
- [source/about/](mdc:hexo-blog/source/about) - About page
- [source/categories/](mdc:hexo-blog/source/categories) - Category pages
- [source/tags/](mdc:hexo-blog/source/tags) - Tag pages

## Theme
- [themes/vivia/](mdc:hexo-blog/themes/vivia) - Current active theme (Vivia)

## Build & Deploy
- [package.json](mdc:hexo-blog/package.json) - NPM dependencies and scripts